  "description": "Shared contracts for Mythosia RAG loading, splitting, embeddings, retrieval, reranking and context building. IRagRetriever and RagRetrievalRequest support query text, lexical overrides, top-K, filters, progress and cancellation without requiring a query embedding. Retains IRetrievalStrategy for existing dense-input implementations. Includes self-contained RagDocument, RagChunk and cloneable pipeline/query options for per-query configuration. What's New in v6.3.0: Optional request-based retriever contracts alongside the existing dense-input strategy.",
