  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v6.3.0: Adds IRagRetriever and RagRetrievalRequest for request-based retrieval without mandatory query embeddings. Requests carry full/lexical query text, top-K, filters and optional progress; RetrieveAsync accepts cancellation. Existing IRetrievalStrategy implementations remain supported. Built-in retrievers use the full query for a null lexical override and skip text search for an empty override. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag.Abstractions/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v630",
